{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thruster</strong> is a precision based rocket control game where every move counts. <br>Pilot your rocket through tight spaces, deadly traps, and physics-based challenges. There\u2019s no health bar one wrong move and you're toast. It\u2019s all about precision, timing, and smart fuel management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-Based Flight</strong> \u2014 Control your rocket using thrusters to move, hover, and boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/1.gif?t=1749803834\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/2.gif?t=1749803834\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/4.gif?t=1749803834\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fuel System</strong> \u2014 Limited fuel keeps the pressure on. Fly near a Fuel-Station to Refill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/extras/3.gif?t=1749803834\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Test Levels</strong> \u2014 5 early levels built for testing mechanics and gathering feedback. <i>(These are planned for the playtest and will appear in early screenshots, but won\u2019t be part of the final release, will be updated over time.)</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expanded Traps</strong> \u2014 More variety like shifting walls, floating objects, and dynamic obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30+ Levels on Full Release</strong> \u2014 A full set of challenging maps with refined gameplay and visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thruster</strong> is a solo-developed project, it's currently in development and will be <strong>free to play</strong> on release. Everything from visuals to mechanics is a work in progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for checking it out. It means a lot!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716480?t=1749803834","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/7c955b3248723cd67d36263dbbcc6b224a97b47a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749803834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/e2c637302d4e9d70ba535e96f10fdf2091399d81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749803834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716480/e2c637302d4e9d70ba535e96f10fdf2091399d81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749803834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thruster</strong> is a precision based rocket control game where every move counts. <br>Pilot your rocket through tight spaces, deadly traps, and physics-based challenges. There\u2019s no health bar one wrong move and you're toast. It\u2019s all about precision, timing, and smart fuel 